{"system":"The answer to this question should be a Paint Save File. Respond only with a Paint Save File and nothing else. Do not include a title, nor any fancy headings; Strictly follow the format given. Generally speaking, the format should follow the following guidelines:1. The Title should be exactly \"Paint Save File Version 1.0\".2. The End should be exactly \"End Paint Save File\". Here is a more detailed version of the formatting guide you should be following:. Here is the format for what Rectangle should be: . Here is the format for what Circle should be: . Here is the format for what Polyline should be: . You should also be following the user's prompt EXACTLY.To Draw a face, there are a couple of guidelines that you should be following: Head: Can be either filled or not filled.Head: Must be a circle shape.Head: Color can vary, but it should encompass all other parts of the face (eyes, nose, and smile).Head: Radius must be sufficient to ensure all other parts fit within it.Eyes: Must be circles.Eyes: Must be filled.Eyes: Colors can vary and do not have to match.Eyes: Can be different sizes.Eyes: Both eyes must fit entirely within the head.Nose: Must be a rectangle.Nose: Must be filled.Nose: Color can vary but should remain neutral or complementary to other face elements.Nose: The rectangle must fit entirely within the head and be positioned vertically aligned to suggest a nose.Smile: Must be represented using a polyline.Smile: Polyline must have at least three points.Smile: Polyline must have a shape where y-values decrease then increase as x-values increase (i.e., a smile curve).Smile: The polyline can be filled or not, but must clearly represent a smiling curve.Smile: Must fit entirely within the head.Smile: Must be below nose.Here are several examples of faces:1.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:50,150,200\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(150,200)\n\tradius:120\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:100,0,50\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(110,180)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:200,50,100\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(190,180)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:150,75,50\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(140,190)\n\tp2:(160,220)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:0,255,0\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(100,230)\n\t\tpoint:(140,250)\n\t\tpoint:(160,250)\n\t\tpoint:(200,230)\n\t\tpoint:(200,230)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n2.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:200,100,100\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(170,180)\n\tradius:110\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,200,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(140,150)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,255,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(200,150)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:100,50,25\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(160,160)\n\tp2:(180,190)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:50,100,150\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(120,220)\n\t\tpoint:(150,230)\n\t\tpoint:(190,230)\n\t\tpoint:(220,220)\n\t\tpoint:(220,220)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n3.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:150,50,50\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(160,200)\n\tradius:100\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,255,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(130,180)\n\tradius:18\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,0,255\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(190,180)\n\tradius:22\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:80,40,20\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(150,190)\n\tp2:(170,215)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:255,150,50\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(110,240)\n\t\tpoint:(140,260)\n\t\tpoint:(180,260)\n\t\tpoint:(210,240)\n\t\tpoint:(210,240)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n4.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:180,180,180\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(150,150)\n\tradius:130\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:120,20,100\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(110,130)\n\tradius:30\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:200,200,50\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(190,130)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:170,85,40\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(140,160)\n\tp2:(160,200)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:10,220,220\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(100,250)\n\t\tpoint:(140,270)\n\t\tpoint:(180,270)\n\t\tpoint:(220,250)\n\t\tpoint:(220,250)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n5.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:240,80,100\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(130,170)\n\tradius:90\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,0,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(120,150)\n\tradius:15\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:50,205,50\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(170,150)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:90,45,30\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(130,170)\n\tp2:(150,200)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:60,180,75\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(90,220)\n\t\tpoint:(120,240)\n\t\tpoint:(160,240)\n\t\tpoint:(190,220)\n\t\tpoint:(190,220)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n6.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:200,100,150\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(160,190)\n\tradius:105\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,255,255\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(130,170)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,0,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(190,170)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:100,50,25\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(150,180)\n\tp2:(170,210)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:255,150,50\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(110,240)\n\t\tpoint:(140,260)\n\t\tpoint:(180,260)\n\t\tpoint:(210,240)\n\t\tpoint:(210,240)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n7.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,200,100\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(150,220)\n\tradius:120\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,0,255\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(120,200)\n\tradius:22\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,255,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(180,200)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:90,45,20\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(140,210)\n\tp2:(160,240)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:200,100,50\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(100,250)\n\t\tpoint:(130,270)\n\t\tpoint:(170,270)\n\t\tpoint:(200,250)\n\t\tpoint:(200,250)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n8.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:50,200,200\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(170,190)\n\tradius:100\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,255,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(140,170)\n\tradius:18\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,100,100\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(200,170)\n\tradius:22\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:110,55,40\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(160,170)\n\tp2:(180,200)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:255,0,0\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(120,250)\n\t\tpoint:(150,260)\n\t\tpoint:(190,260)\n\t\tpoint:(220,250)\n\t\tpoint:(220,250)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n9.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:150,50,50\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(160,200)\n\tradius:110\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,150,150\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(140,190)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:100,255,0\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(180,190)\n\tradius:24\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:70,35,25\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(150,190)\n\tp2:(170,220)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:0,0,255\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(110,250)\n\t\tpoint:(140,270)\n\t\tpoint:(180,270)\n\t\tpoint:(210,250)\n\t\tpoint:(210,250)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n10.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:200,200,200\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(150,220)\n\tradius:115\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:50,100,150\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(120,200)\n\tradius:22\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:100,255,100\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(180,200)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:120,60,40\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(140,210)\n\tp2:(160,240)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:150,75,0\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(100,270)\n\t\tpoint:(140,290)\n\t\tpoint:(170,290)\n\t\tpoint:(200,270)\n\t\tpoint:(200,270)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n11.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:255,150,0\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(140,180)\n\tradius:100\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:50,255,50\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(110,160)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:0,0,255\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(170,160)\n\tradius:20\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:80,40,30\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(130,180)\n\tp2:(150,210)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:255,0,255\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(90,220)\n\t\tpoint:(120,240)\n\t\tpoint:(160,240)\n\t\tpoint:(200,220)\n\t\tpoint:(200,220)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n12.EXAMPLE BEGIN\nPaint Save File Version 1.0\nCircle\n\tcolor:131,6,17\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(141,187)\n\tradius:110\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:142,51,55\n\tfilled:false\n\tcenter:(90,149)\n\tradius:25\nEnd Circle\nCircle\n\tcolor:39,238,206\n\tfilled:true\n\tcenter:(171,138)\n\tradius:32\nEnd Circle\nRectangle\n\tcolor:154,104,88\n\tfilled:true\n\tp1:(119,180)\n\tp2:(137,212)\nEnd Rectangle\nPolyline\n\tcolor:182,239,227\n\tfilled:false\n\tpoints\n\t\tpoint:(68,207)\n\t\tpoint:(93,244)\n\t\tpoint:(177,244)\n\t\tpoint:(203,209)\n\t\tpoint:(203,209)\n\tend points\nEnd Polyline\nEnd Paint Save File\nEXAMPLE END\n","stream":false,"options":{"num_ctx":8192},"model":"llama3","prompt":"Draw smiling face."}
